Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: catalog.c
Line: 1303
Function: xmlParseXMLCatalogNode
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: entry is dereferenced in the nextCatalog de-duplication loop without a NULL check. xmlParseXMLCatalogOneNode() can return NULL (e.g., missing 'catalog' attribute or failed URI construction), leading to dereferencing entry->URL, entry->prefer, and entry->group.

